      "branch": 5368847933,
      "unreachable_target": 5368848027,
      "reason": "For arbitrary uint32 x, x*(x+1) is even and x XOR (x+1) has bit zero set. Therefore (~product)&xor has bit zero set; TEST cl,1 clears ZF and JE cannot be taken.",
